&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account Manager, Enterprise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Manager, you will be responsible for developing strong relationships by earning trust with our customers, and providing impactful payments insights to help them grow. Our Account Managers are empowered to own the customer relationship and provide best-in-class service to our customers. In this role, you’ll contribute to our ongoing momentum by understanding the unique customer need and identifying commercial opportunities, including expansion opportunities and the addition of value adding products. Self-motivated and resourceful, you’ll bring a strategic mindset and commercial approach to the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sounds exciting? Keep reading!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
