&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic consultation:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the human dimension of Adyen’s product, delivering expertise, education, and payment guidance to customers. Position Adyen as a trusted partner and use data to tell compelling stories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project management:&lt;/strong&gt; Prioritize and execute on short and long term projects with varying timelines across multiple accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feedback:&lt;/strong&gt; Be the voice and champion for your customer internally and serve as a feedback loop&lt;/li&gt;
