&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Counsel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are looking for a driven and enthusiastic Commercial Counsel based in New York to join&lt;br&gt;the global Deal Desk within the Commercial Legal team at Adyen. As Commercial Counsel,&lt;br&gt;you will be responsible for negotiating customer-facing contract negotiations, primarily&lt;br&gt;focused on enterprise customers. You will also be responsible for drafting comprehensive&lt;br&gt;negotiation playbooks, training our commercial colleagues on how to sell our agreements,&lt;br&gt;advising on contract interpretation, early-stage customer disputes, and other general&lt;br&gt;commercial matters.&lt;br&gt;This is a role for a counsel who thrives in a fast-moving, complex environment, who is&lt;br&gt;commercially-minded, and who can leverage their sophisticated legal expertise and strong&lt;br&gt;communication skills into tangible, scalable value that accelerates Adyen’s global growth.&lt;/p&gt;
