&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with C-level and senior decision-makers, and develop multi-threaded engagement across buyer groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex commercial conversations by clearly articulating Adyen’s value across payments, financial technology, and broader business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
