&lt;li&gt;Shape deal strategy, handle objections effectively, and negotiate mutually beneficial commercial outcomes while protecting long-term value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with internal teams including Sales Support, Implementation, Account Management, BDR, and other cross-functional stakeholders to drive high-quality customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a strong market representative for Adyen in DACH by bringing insight on customer needs, competitive dynamics, and regional business culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to team excellence through knowledge sharing, mentoring, and example-setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel and network regularly across the region to strengthen market presence and develop new business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
