&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Content Team Lead&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Adyen’s Global Marketing team consists of multiple disciplines working together to enable local marketing teams around the world with the resources, strategic frameworks, and subject matter expertise they need to drive demand and retention. Our in-house creative Studio is responsible for bringing these programs to life through creation of reports, assets for events, online videos, case studies, blogs, and more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The studio consists of two sub-teams: on the one hand there’s the Design team that takes care of visuals and on the other there’s our Content team, comprising writers &amp;amp; content managers. We’re looking for an experienced team lead to steer that writing arm of our Studio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and coordinate the production of content projects from brief to launch in collaboration with the Studio Leadership Team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and own our global content strategy aimed at translating complex product and commercial propositions into easy to understand, memorable experiences that drive action with our business target audiences. This includes but is not limited to guides, case studies, web &amp;amp; digital, videos, events,, and social content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, inspire and mentor a matrixed content team, reviewing, editing, and conceptualizing work that is on-brand and aligned to our commercial goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a guardian of the Adyen tone of voice and content related guidelines, responsible for evolving these in accordance with business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with our global marketeers and local markets to understand their content requirements, turning these into actionable plans and creative activations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with agency partners and freelancers to deliver a consistently high standard of creative work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
