&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You embody the&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.adyen.com/&quot;&gt; Adyen Formula&lt;/a&gt;, love to collaborate, and believe winning is more important than ego.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 7+ years of experience directly leading content teams, you know how to manage stakeholders, and you&#39;re familiar with leading &amp;amp; influencing across regions and timezones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a passion for investigating and solving customer problems (both our B2B target audience as well as our internal clients).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the ability to grasp complex, technical subjects and distill them into meaningful stories, collateral, and messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a brand thinker, you understand strategy, brand positioning, and know how to create effective and persuasive creative that is aligned to commercial goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are detail oriented and able to thrive in a high-paced, dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are able to work with a high degree of autonomy, and know how to navigate ambiguous situations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
