&lt;p&gt;The annual base salary range for this role in San Francisco is &lt;strong&gt;$195,000 - $263,000&lt;/strong&gt;. Compensation is based on factors including qualifications, experience, and location. Total compensation package includes equity (RSUs), 401(k), health, dental, vision, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
