&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Head of Demand Generation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Adyen, we are at the forefront of financial technology, driving innovation in payments for enterprise businesses globally. We are seeking a strategic and results-driven &lt;strong&gt;Head of Demand Generation&lt;/strong&gt; to lead and scale our North America demand gen efforts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a critical leadership role responsible for driving significant year-over-year growth in qualified pipeline and shaping how we go to market across priority verticals and enterprise accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be a senior stakeholder in developing our GTM strategy alongside Marketing, Sales, BDR, and Partnerships leadership. You’ll help translate our business priorities into integrated plans for how we create, capture, and convert enterprise demand across priority verticals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A critical part of this role is leading and developing the team. You will lead a team of marketers with a strong focus on generating demand within specific verticals through account-based marketing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will build on this foundation, and will centralize demand generation best practices while empowering the team to maintain deep vertical expertise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This hybrid role is based in our &lt;strong&gt;New York or San Francisco office&lt;/strong&gt; and reports directly to the VP of Marketing, North America. We are an office-first company and value in-person collaboration. We do not offer remote-only roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale our pipeline engine:&lt;/strong&gt; Build a demand gen engine that consistently creates qualified pipeline and can scale to support ambitious growth targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape our GTM strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Marketing, Sales, BDR, and Partnerships leaders to translate business priorities into integrated, verticalized GTM plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate enterprise ABM:&lt;/strong&gt; Evolve our ABM strategy and capabilities to create and accelerate demand across accounts, verticals, and buying groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure and optimize:&lt;/strong&gt; Use data, market insights, and campaign performance to identify new avenues for growth, determine where to invest or scale back, and develop new demand generation motions where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and develop the team:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and develop a high-performing team, strengthening its operating model, strategic capabilities, and talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish the operating model: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate with events and integrated marketers&amp;nbsp; to establish clear planning, measurement, forecasting, and accountability across verticals and programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale marketing excellence: &lt;/strong&gt;Synthesize and share campaign learnings, frameworks, and best practices to continuously raise the bar for demand generation within the region and globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 12+ years of B2B marketing experience with a focus on enterprise demand, including at least 4 years of team leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder and scaler: &lt;/strong&gt;You know how to take an existing foundation, identify what is working, and build the systems, capabilities, and team required to scale it. You move fluidly between setting the strategy and getting into the details needed to make it successful, with a strong bias toward data, experimentation, and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise expert:&lt;/strong&gt; You understand how to create demand within complex enterprise accounts and orchestrate Marketing, Sales, BDRs, and Partnerships around high-value opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vertical fluency:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;You know how to build deep domain knowledge, uncover unique buyer pain points, and translate those insights into effective campaign strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-driven mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; High data literacy with hands-on experience using marketing analytics and tools to track full-funnel performance and optimize ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Builder:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a track record of leading demand gen teams and know how to create clarity, accountability, and evolve an organization as the business grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adyen Formula:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;You have a builder mentality and operate with high autonomy, direct communication, and speed. You balance this bias for action with a low-ego mindset, actively seeking diverse perspectives and prioritizing collective team wins over individual ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other details:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be available to travel domestically and internationally up to 20%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
