&lt;li&gt;Built or scaled AI, automation, or digital workflow improvements beyond small experiments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Worked closely with engineering or technical teams and can hold your own in those conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influenced senior leaders and moved cross-functional agendas forward without relying only on formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
