&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience educating others on complex ideas, communicating them clearly and providing additional training when necessary.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ability to structure and prioritize work in a high volume, fast-paced environment and build and drive processes to completion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Enjoy critically considering process flows and seeking to improve efficiency wherever possible.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
