&lt;li&gt;Define and execute the Customer Support technology strategy, including Service Cloud alongside other tools such as QA, WFM, and telephony platforms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Service Cloud roadmap, balancing needs across global Adyen teams sharing the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
