&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial judgment, with the ability to balance growth objectives against regulatory, partner, and operational risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience evaluating new business models or payment flows and defining clear guardrails for launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management skills, with the ability to influence senior leaders and drive alignment across functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in ambiguity and making decisions in fast-moving, high-growth environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and coaching high-performing teams, particularly in roles that require both strategic thinking and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to think creatively about merchant use cases that sit outside standard network constructs, and to turn those edge cases into scalable, product-enabled solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
