&lt;li&gt;Experienced in project coordination or delivery, operations, customer-facing roles, or technical project environments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational and communication skills with attention to detail;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable managing multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-focused mindset with strong collaboration skills;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interested in technical systems, operational processes, and project delivery;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work effectively with international and cross-functional teams;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in French and English required. Additional European languages are a plus;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel domestically and internationally where required.&lt;/li&gt;
