&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The base salary range for this role is $210,000- $275,000. &lt;/strong&gt;To learn more about our compensation philosophy, please click&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/11U2tgFev7p271JMQWMApZjtpJ3pGHNES7EvscXnsH3k/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Location &amp;amp; Work Model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is based out of our New York office. We are an office-first company and value in-person collaboration; we do not offer remote-only roles.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
