&lt;li&gt;Experience handling legal escalations, settlements, charge-offs or third-party agency placements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with data: SQL, Looker or similar tools to analyze delinquency trends and build reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of improving a collections process, building a playbook or helping automate a workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
