&lt;p&gt;At Adyen, we treat data and data artifacts as first-class citizens. In this role, you&#39;ll be at the core of our data strategy by helping us in building the best-in-class data platform for payments, and creating meaningful data products that drive our external and internal stakeholders. You’ll be the advocate of the core data products we offer, and you&#39;ll align product evolution and technical challenges aiming global-scale, with stakeholders located at every corner of the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we expect from you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with stakeholders across countries and regions, and design solutions with global scale in mind, so our merchants are supported wherever they do business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative solution development:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with data scientists, analysts, software engineers, product managers and customers across our global offices to understand their needs and craft effective solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;State-of-the-art pipelines and architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, develop, deploy and operate production ELT pipelines and data architectures that handle data from many sources and formats, at the scale of a global payments platform. Build for compatibility, consistency, reliability and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion data best practices:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish and advocate for best practices in performance, code quality, data validation, governance and discoverability across Adyen, mentoring and sharing knowledge with colleagues in different regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-quality data and code:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure data is accurate, complete, reliable, relevant and timely, with rigorous testing, monitoring and validation (for example, with Pytest), because our merchants and partners around the world depend on it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify and resolve bottlenecks in pipelines and systems, optimizing query performance and resource use to meet SLAs at global scale, using caching, indexing, partitioning and other Spark optimizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
