&lt;p&gt;Together with the global GTM Operations and Revenue Technology teams, you will help drive a universal, end-to-end commercial process that is continuously optimized to meet the needs of our markets. You will also collaborate with the regional analytics team to translate data insights into actionable growth opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
