&lt;li&gt;Partner with NA regional leadership (President, VP’s, Heads of) to elevate GTM execution, including operationalizing strategic initiatives, leading workshops and business reviews, and co-creating and facilitating the execution of the GTM strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translating insights into improvements and solutions, and driving teams to solve them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Championing and executing the global Revenue Operations agenda and initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand process gaps that degrade data hygiene in NA and identify operational improvements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence implementation and enablement of processes, systems and tools&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support commercial goal setting for the region in collaboration with Regional Analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align on prioritization with Revenue Technology and the global GTM Ops team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect the dots with other regional teams to exchange best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
