&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Implementation Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Implementation Engineer at Adyen, you will lead the design and delivery of mission-critical payment integrations for some of the world’s largest global companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will influence how global enterprises design and operate their payment infrastructure at scale. Your work will directly impact the reliability, performance, and scalability of payment flows used by millions of end customers worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is focused on solving complex, high-scale technical challenges. You will also shape technical direction, influence product evolution, and mentor implementers across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in London, and the ideal candidate is both consultative and technical.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will design and scale highly resilient, high-performance integration architectures while helping raise the technical bar across the implementation organization.&lt;/p&gt;
