&lt;li&gt;Define and ensure technical standards across implementation engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a strategic technical advisor in both pre-sales and delivery phases, shaping solutions alongside Sales and senior merchant stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape industry standards and the broader ecosystem by defining how large-scale payment architectures are built and scaled&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster best practices in reliability, scalability, security, and system design (e.g. idempotency, fault tolerance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and support Implementation Engineers across the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and Engineering to influence platform evolution and new product design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage critical escalations and ensure stability of high-scale merchant integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience in software engineering or technical consulting with deep API integration experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep system design and distributed systems expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate as a solution architect and trusted advisor in complex, enterprise environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to production-level systems with pragmatic engineering trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable engaging with senior technical and business stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to mentor and develop engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid decision-making capability in complex and ambiguous environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for raising technical excellence across teams and organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in environments where collaboration, accountability, and impact go hand in hand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
