&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Senior Manager, Application Engineering&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Adyen’s Application Engineering team builds, runs, and automates the core platforms Adyen uses every day to collaborate: the Atlassian suite, Slack Enterprise Grid, Google Workspace, Zoom, and the emerging AI tooling that connects them (such as Claude, Gemini Enterprise, and Rovo). We are looking for an experienced engineering leader who has guided workplace collaboration, tooling, or internal platforms teams, and who excels at translating complex backlogs into clear, high-impact deliverables.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;In this role, you will lead a team of 11+ engineers, own the platform roadmap, and partner closely with cross-functional stakeholders who rely on our productivity ecosystem across the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;***(internally, the role is being called Team Lead, Application Engineering)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
