&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Project Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Guide projects end-to-end—from scoping and planning through delivery and rollout—establishing clear milestones, ownership, risk management, and progress reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
