&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Vendor Partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee SaaS vendor relationships, licensing strategies, and contract renewals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;People Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Mentor, support, and grow a team of Enterprise Applications Engineers. Set transparent goals, provide constructive feedback to support career progression, and lead using Adyen’s framework: &lt;em data-path-to-node=&quot;10,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;208&quot;&gt;Empower, Care, Act, Scale&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,7,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Team Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead hiring initiatives and intentionally shape team organization and capabilities as Adyen scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,8,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Set and sustain standards for documentation, operational hygiene, and support escalation to ensure long-term platform resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,9,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technical Guidance:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain active technical engagement by participating in architecture decisions, code reviews, and integration designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
