&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Execution &amp;amp; Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Skilled in complex project management—proficient at estimating, tracking, and shipping parallel initiatives while keeping distributed stakeholders informed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;SaaS Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Practical experience operating and scaling enterprise collaboration platforms (e.g., Atlassian suite, Slack Enterprise Grid, Google Workspace, Zoom).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technical Foundation:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid architectural understanding of productivity and enterprise platforms, enabling you to make sound technical trade-offs and evaluate engineering solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Pragmatic AI Adoption:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with implementing internal AI/LLM-enabled workflows and a practical perspective on deploying them safely and effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Security Awareness:&lt;/strong&gt; A security-first mindset with familiarity handling identity and access management (IAM), data privacy, and compliance requirements in a regulated environment.&lt;/li&gt;
