&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience in partner engineering, telecom engineering, technical account management, solutions engineering, or a similar partner-facing technical role.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Proven experience owning complex external technical relationships and driving partners toward clear commitments and resolution.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of cellular connectivity, including LTE/4G/5G, SIM/eSIM, roaming, APNs, mobile networks, IoT connectivity, or managed connectivity platforms.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong troubleshooting skills across distributed connectivity environments involving multiple technical domains and external parties.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience with incident and problem management, RCA, corrective actions, and challenging incomplete technical explanations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
