&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Structured, pragmatic, and comfortable creating clarity and scalable ways of working in ambiguous environments.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comfortable working independently across time zones and traveling to partner locations when needed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You create predictable and technically credible relationships with Adyen’s cellular connectivity partners.&lt;br&gt;Partners understand Adyen’s priorities and technical expectations; commitments have clear ownership; significant incidents are investigated effectively; RCA and corrective actions are credible and completed; service changes are technically assessed; and recurring issues result in measurable improvements rather than repeated escalations.&lt;br&gt;As the connectivity landscape grows, the operating model scales with it without making Hardware Partnership Engineering a gatekeeper or the owner of work that belongs with the connectivity provider or another Adyen team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
