&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Senior Product Manager to lead our Anti-Money Laundering (AML) detection product within Identity &amp;amp; Risk Intelligence. Financial crime keeps getting more complex, and as Adyen expands into new products and markets, our detection needs to scale with it - without becoming a bottleneck for growth. &lt;br&gt;This role needs a Product Manager who can take a clear strategy and drive it to execution, make strong trade-offs, and build trust with Compliance and other senior stakeholders. You need a track record of building ML-driven products in a regulated environment. You&#39;ll lead a team of Data Scientists, Data Analysts and Backend Engineers, and work closely with Compliance, Operations and other product teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk Detection &amp;amp; ML Modeling:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the build and scaling of Machine Learning models, rules and risk signals that detect financial crimes across Adyen&#39;s products, markets and customer base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scalable, Self-Service Detection:&lt;/strong&gt; Move financial crime detection toward a self-service framework that picks up new typologies quickly, using ML, GenAI and agentic approaches to reduce manual effort and keep pace with Adyen&#39;s growth without adding headcount.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy Execution &amp;amp; Prioritization:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the execution of the financial crime detection strategy. Prioritize ruthlessly, make data-driven trade-offs, and stop or descope work when the evidence shows it is not worth pursuing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance &amp;amp; Regulatory Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the main product partner for Compliance. Translate regulatory expectations into clear product boundaries, agree how the team delivers within them, and demonstrate continuous improvement to regulators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance &amp;amp; Effectiveness:&lt;/strong&gt; Define how detection quality and efficiency are measured in a domain where the ground truth is often unknown, and continuously improve signal quality for our Investigations team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead a team of Data Scientists, Data Analysts and Backend Engineers alongside your engineering lead, and keep Compliance, Operations, and other risk teams aligned on the roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 8+ years of Product Management experience building ML-driven, high-scale products in fast-growing tech or fintech environments. 2+ years of experience in AML, fraud detection or financial crime.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ML Product Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of owning and scaling ML-driven products such as detection, scoring or risk models. Comfortable going deep with Data Scientists on model performance, evaluation and trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulated Environment:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience building products in highly regulated environments such as payments, banking or fintech, with a solid understanding of how regulation shapes product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong influence with senior and opinionated stakeholders, especially Compliance, Legal and Risk. Able to hold a position, explain the reasoning and keep their trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Decision-Making:&lt;/strong&gt; Clear, data-driven trade-offs and the confidence to say no. Comfortable owning outcomes without a single clean success metric.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Highly autonomous and accountable, able to take an agreed strategy and drive it through execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
