&lt;li&gt;Beyond filling roles, you ensure the quality of hire by translating recruitment data and market intelligence into actionable coaching for hiring managers, fostering a culture of data-informed decision-making.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be responsible for the candidates’ experience from their first contact with Adyen to the offer management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a global team member with the recruitment team, you share best practices and market intelligence to upskill the broader team beyond APAC&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
