&lt;li&gt;You bring significant full-cycle recruiting experience, including at least 4+ years &lt;strong&gt;in-house&lt;/strong&gt; within fast-paced tech, SaaS, or global organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable operating in a high-ownership environment proactively sourcing and engaging talent across niche and competitive markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business fluency in &lt;strong&gt;Japanese (native or JLPT N1 equivalent)&lt;/strong&gt; is strongly preferred to effectively partner with local stakeholders and candidates in Japan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience living or working in Japan is a plus, as it provides the cultural context necessary to navigate the local talent market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You built talent pipelines from scratch, conducting market mapping, and influencing hiring decisions in competitive hiring environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You strategically collaborate with HRBPs, Rewards and the Business ensuring our APAC talent strategy is aligned with long-term business goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a wealth of experience in collecting Recruiting data and leading data informed conversations to support and influence hiring decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
