&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unified Platform&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Unified Platform is at the heart of Adyen’s infrastructure, bringing together accounting, reporting, billing, pricing, reconciliation, and configuration into one streamlined experience. It enables us to stay agile and innovative while running a scalable, efficient business. As part of this initiative, we’re rethinking five core product areas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform experience&lt;/strong&gt; – Creating a unified and intuitive backend experience across Adyen products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accounting systems&lt;/strong&gt; – Defining a cohesive and high-performing financial architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; reconciliation&lt;/strong&gt; – Making financial data more accurate, accessible, and satisfying for customers and regulators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Billing &amp;amp; pricing infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt; – Simplifying pricing and automating invoicing at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Observability &amp;amp; tooling &lt;/strong&gt;– Strengthening visibility and control of money movement through advanced tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;.While all roles share a strong technical foundation, each team brings a unique focus in scaling our unified platform, We&#39;ll explore the best team fit together throughout the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
