&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Staff Engineer - Payments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Engineer in the Payments organization, you will act as a trusted advisor and shape the future of how businesses and shoppers interact with Adyen&#39;s payment platform. Operating at the intersection of mobile technology, point-of-sale systems, and backend services, you will drive the technical direction for our Terminal and Mobile experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly hands-on technical leadership role. You will architect unified shopper journeys, solve complex challenges across the payments ecosystem, and multiply the impact of the teams around you. By driving technical decisions through ambiguity and establishing foundational architecture, you will lead the evolution of Adyen&#39;s next generation of payment experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the next generation of payment experiences:&lt;/strong&gt; Help Adyen evolve beyond traditional terminal and mobile boundaries toward seamless shopper and merchant experiences across devices, applications, and payment surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect &amp;amp; Innovate:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and drive the long-term technical strategy for complex payment experiences spanning mobile apps, SDKs, payment terminals, and distributed backend systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve Complex Problems:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the resolution of challenging technical issues involving reliability, performance, security, payment flows, and device compatibility at a global scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Strategic Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a strategic partner to Product, Design, Legal, and other stakeholders. Translate ambiguous business goals into executable plans, balance short-term delivery with long-term investments, and confidently push back using data and prototypes (POCs) to drive consensus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Across Boundaries:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish clear architectural boundaries, APIs, and integration patterns that enable cross-functional teams to move independently.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop Technical Talent:&lt;/strong&gt; Mentor engineers across levels. Tailor your coaching to help Senior Engineers tackle complex problems independently, while demystifying internal systems and explaining the &quot;why&quot; behind decisions for Junior Engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion Engineering Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Raise the bar for observability, testing, and operational excellence. Work internally and with external technology partners (e.g., OS providers, hardware vendors) to ensure robust, secure integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 10+ years of hands-on software engineering experience in modern production environments, with a proven track record operating at a Staff-level scope.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mobile Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of direct, hands-on mobile development experience with proven proficiency in either &lt;strong&gt;Android (Kotlin) OR iOS (Swift)&lt;/strong&gt;. You have shipped and owned production mobile code, not just directed it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Platform Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong willingness and demonstrated ability to cross-train onto the mobile platform you don&#39;t currently specialize in. You must be comfortable working across platform boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; A proactive relationship-builder who can set technical direction and influence without formal authority, manage diverse stakeholders across time zones, and build alignment on difficult technical decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of mobile architecture, SDK design, concurrency, performance, and large-scale distributed systems. Experience building and maintaining merchant- or consumer-facing SDKs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; The ability to generalize complex processes into simple, flexible services and SDKs that support multiple products and teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; A self-starter mindset with the ability to identify critical problems, determine what needs to change, and drive solutions to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
