&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 10+ years of hands-on software engineering experience in modern production environments, with a proven track record operating at a Staff-level scope.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mobile Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of direct, hands-on mobile development experience with proven proficiency in either &lt;strong&gt;Android (Kotlin) OR iOS (Swift)&lt;/strong&gt;. You have shipped and owned production mobile code, not just directed it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Platform Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong willingness and demonstrated ability to cross-train onto the mobile platform you don&#39;t currently specialize in. You must be comfortable working across platform boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; A proactive relationship-builder who can set technical direction and influence without formal authority, manage diverse stakeholders across time zones, and build alignment on difficult technical decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of mobile architecture, SDK design, concurrency, performance, and large-scale distributed systems. Experience building and maintaining merchant- or consumer-facing SDKs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; The ability to generalize complex processes into simple, flexible services and SDKs that support multiple products and teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; A self-starter mindset with the ability to identify critical problems, determine what needs to change, and drive solutions to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
