&lt;li&gt;You will &lt;strong&gt;coach, mentor, and manage members&lt;/strong&gt; of the team and give direct feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will &lt;strong&gt;manage capacity planning&lt;/strong&gt;, including determining global coverage and weekend shifts with your peers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will &lt;strong&gt;work closely with compliance&lt;/strong&gt; to improve quality assurance scores.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will &lt;strong&gt;proactively manage escalations&lt;/strong&gt; and ensure platform merchants have an excellent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will &lt;strong&gt;actively anticipate new product launches&lt;/strong&gt; and their impact on operational flows, ensuring new requirements are implemented in a scalable way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
