&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement Driver:&lt;/strong&gt; You are obsessed with quality. You have experience working closely with Compliance and Product teams to continuously improve QA scores and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Escalation Expert:&lt;/strong&gt; You possess exceptional stakeholder management skills and are the go-to leader for navigating complex merchant escalations and high-stakes problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent Communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; You communicate clearly in English, comfortably bridging the gap between technical requirements and non-technical stakeholders across the globe.&lt;/li&gt;
