&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Our Docs Excellence team is looking for a systems-minded Technical Writer to join us in Chicago. This isn&#39;t a traditional writing role: we treat technical content as structured, living knowledge rather than static pages, and you&#39;ll operate as equal parts System Builder and Technical Curator.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll step into an established documentation practice: existing style guidelines, a domain-based team structure, and a workflow that blends traditional technical writing with AI-assisted tooling, and you&#39;ll help evolve it further as a Knowledge Architect. As &lt;strong&gt;System Builder&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll design the metadata schemas, ontology, and context rules that guide automated first-pass content generation. As &lt;strong&gt;Technical Curator&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll apply exceptional editorial judgment to review, fact-check, and refine that output into precise, trustworthy, and well-structured developer documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and maintain metadata schemas (YAML front matter), ontology, and rules that support automated, first-pass content generation workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review, edit, and fact-check auto-generated content and code snippets for technical accuracy, edge cases, and voice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Author and refine API reference guides, integration workflows, and conceptual docs in a docs-as-code environment (Git, Markdown).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Managers, Engineers, Support, and Implementation Managers to capture platform logic and validate merchant integration flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure documentation so it works for two audiences at once: human developers navigating integrations, and AI systems parsing context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years documenting complex technical spaces, including APIs, SDKs, or developer platforms, with a portfolio that shows real writing and editing craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable thinking beyond the page: you can design ontologies, metadata schemas, and structured information models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high-judgment editor who can spot hallucinations, inaccuracies, or structural gaps in automated drafts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully fluent in Git, Markdown, and docs-as-code toolchains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A practical, hands-on user of AI tools and LLMs to gather context and streamline documentation work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone who asks why before executing. We value critical thinking and problem-solving as much as craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable managing multiple stakeholders and adapting to a fast-moving, evolving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Postman, VS Code, or similar tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic ability to read code snippets (Java, Python, TypeScript) to verify API logic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team &amp;amp; Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;ll join a global community of 15 writers, supported by 2 engineering teams and a senior PM across Amsterdam, Madrid, and Chicago. This role is based in our Chicago office; we operate a hybrid model (3 days/week in office).&lt;/p&gt;
